{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given the binary operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17950ad2ab63c764778b133f95a03dcf2969d57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\star$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/9/609eed92a12fcbf45f6780321d23c726f562e4d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\star b=a^b$\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> for all positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Then for all positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/e/1fe1842d9f07bba882135b6497ffb1173ec75297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" />, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578b46afcdd564b7c47d9e9d58582fe0d84ecb78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } a\\star b=b\\star a\\quad\\qquad\\qquad\\ \\text{(B) } a\\star (b\\star c)=(a\\star b) \\star c\\quad\\\\ \\text{(C) } (a\\star b^n)=(a \\star n) \\star b\\quad \\text{(D) } (a\\star b)^n =a\\star (bn)\\quad\\\\ \\text{(E) None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"415\" height=\"57\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb0ff1a824dcd25d19a4c1c371fea1a860315d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2, b = 3, c=n = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"176\" height=\"16\" />.  If all of them are false, the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.  If one does not fail, we will try to prove it.\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/4/b74b2ed818aa4c1de06f97fe059aa85658f2fd3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 = 3^2$\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />, which is clearly false.\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c829bcd74bd998877e38fbdf65499d8682327fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{81} = 8^{4}$\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />, which is false.\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/e/4de298f443ce051deb79f24d423a221954160be9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{81} = 16^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />, which is false.\n</p><p>For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b7acb60bd005492c3f7c573f5e7a323ea6a9a02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^4 = 2^{12}$\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, which is true.\n</p><p>The LHS is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61ec66942e2d5cdf58f74925bfd7bf4644fbf948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^b)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"22\" />.  By the elementary definition of exponentiation, this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8be4a03400384a2719b865cf815f46d4f857be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> multiplied by itself <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> times.  Since each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8be4a03400384a2719b865cf815f46d4f857be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is actually <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> multiplied <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> times, the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61ec66942e2d5cdf58f74925bfd7bf4644fbf948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^b)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"22\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> multiplied by itself <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830f271433470ab3f92cfa5c539a1c7dbd036e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bn$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> times.  \n</p><p>The RHS is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/3/f035d899c13e1f86daffd1daa7d9ab213026ce9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{bn}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" />.  This is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> multiplied by itself <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830f271433470ab3f92cfa5c539a1c7dbd036e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bn$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> times.\n</p><p>Thus, the LHS is always equal to the RHS, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> is the only correct statement.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017170158\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 260/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 176/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post